  Slug: clown
  DisplayName: Clown
  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Although you've spent time in greasepaint and colorful clothing to
    amuse crowds, your skills with buffoonery and physical comedy are exceptional
    whether or not you're in costume. In the employ of Mistress Dusklight's Celestial
    Menagerie, you spent too many routines distracting an audience from an ill-timed
    accident or evidence of abused animals or performers. You've had enough of that,
    and the Celestial Menagerie isn't your home any longer. Choose two attribute
    boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Charisma , and one is a free attribute boost.
    You're trained in the Performance skill and the Clown Lore skill. You gain the
    Virtuosic Performer (Comedy) skill feat.
  SourceTitle: Pathfinder Extinction Curse Player's Guide
